{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/violet-tower-dubai-Investments-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":643,"crm_id":"1534","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Violet Tower","slug":"violet-tower-dubai-Investments-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) ","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Dubai Investments","price":998966,"display_price":"998K","lattitude":25.0538176,"longitude":55.2007763,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Violet Tower is an amazing project by Dubai Investments, located in one of the fastest growing neighbourhoods in Dubai - JVC. The development is a 27-storey tower offering luxury studios and apartments with <strong>1-2 bedrooms.</strong></p><p>Violet Tower stands out for its contemporary architecture, elegant design and exquisite finishes, with wide windows on the exterior providing an abundance of natural light and panoramic views of the vibrant neighbourhood. Balconies and public areas contribute to the aesthetic appeal, offering residents a harmonious blend of urban living and natural beauty.</p><p>There are a variety of amenities located within the complex to ensure comfortable living. Among them, residents will find a cosy lounge area with recreational facilities, a large outdoor swimming pool, a gym with the most modern equipment and a children's playground. In the immediate vicinity of the complex there are kindergartens, schools, medical centres, shopping outlets, cafes and restaurants.</p><p>Violet Tower's convenient location in the heart of JVC allows you to reach the city's main attractions in just a few minutes. Residents have easy access to several major thoroughfares and streets of Dubai. Circle Mall and Dubai Hills Mall are just 7 minutes away. Dubai Marina, Mall of the Emirates, Burj Al Arab and Downtown Dubai are all within 10-15 minutes. Jumeirah Beach, Palm Jumeirah, Museum of the Future, Dubai International Airport and Dubai World Trade Centre are all within a 20-30 minute radius.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/9woyn9my1P6YEKvSJOc484QfingEVyr82TXuX2Zb.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/9woyn9my1P6YEKvSJOc484QfingEVyr82TXuX2Zb.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/UjBmcXC1ixeS2Q2M4R8wQ70hakKp9AZKHX4QgZIU.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/UjBmcXC1ixeS2Q2M4R8wQ70hakKp9AZKHX4QgZIU.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/LzCmLqQS42UvlqVYOPu60OBRJeYW1H4HhYkv9NF7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/LzCmLqQS42UvlqVYOPu60OBRJeYW1H4HhYkv9NF7.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/jOaUypGVgAzm8V0kDmfLBLJhk48zBkZ3LMzgSK3K.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/jOaUypGVgAzm8V0kDmfLBLJhk48zBkZ3LMzgSK3K.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/h7wXb6ovLXe2R70ulVhQYSLlf3SNyvysSncYBDxQ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/h7wXb6ovLXe2R70ulVhQYSLlf3SNyvysSncYBDxQ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/9RTxPJDYrOPb6jYvVfmoB8QdQ2eLkFDSPBfqx53w.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/03/27/9RTxPJDYrOPb6jYvVfmoB8QdQ2eLkFDSPBfqx53w.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1534/images/2024/03/27/5F0EQKFBOhBU5Dx1VEux1Jn7ecBihXt4PYuWmCKB.jpg","src